:"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-a2[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Add the ci_watch lumberjack chop for SASE CI health and release [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]merges[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A bugyi_chop_ci_watch script chop sweeps GitHub Actions health for [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]all SASE repos every five minutes, proposes at most one CI-fix [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]agent per tick and only when zero other agents are running, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]deterministically merges green release-please/release-plz PRs once [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]explicitly enabled, and ships configured (merges off) as an athena [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]lumberjack lane.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]ci_watch_chop.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Thread source and dry_run into the chop script contract[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]chop-context-flags[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chop-context-flags: add source and dry_run to ChopScriptContext with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]SASE_CHOP_SOURCE/SASE_CHOP_DRY_RUN env mirrors and a tolerant reader, so[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mutation-capable chop scripts can honor sase axe chop run --dry-run.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Implement bugyi_chop_ci_watch in bugyi-chops[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ci-watch-chop[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ci-watch-chop: implement the actstat sweep, per-repo classification, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]zero-agents-gated fix proposals, guarded release-PR merging, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notifications, and a fake-adapter test suite in the bugyi-chops repo.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Configure the athena ci_watch lane and deploy[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]athena-rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ci-watch-chop[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]athena-rollout: add the chop-owned actstat config and ci_watch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lumberjack lane in chezmoi, apply with chezmoi, refresh the installed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bugyi-chops, and dry-run smoke test the chop.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-a2","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","phase_bead_id":"sase-a2.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d3a5de74088638c3c286e2f38df4d4c3","started_at":"2026-07-27T16:52:56.967228+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-a2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-a2.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-a2.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-a2.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-a2.land"]}
